- Finalize supplier agreements with SecureCode Systems and PrecisionParts Manufacturing
- Submit regulatory filings for certification by 2025-03-08
- Conduct customer workshops with Neo-City Development Authority and EuroGrid Energy

**Short-term Milestones (Next 90 days):**
